  "releaseNotes": "Added peSHIr.CmdLine.ConsoleProgress which implements IShowProgress by writing to System.Console for you. Plus, peSHIr.Text.LanguageSupport.StandardText (nl/en/de) now includes the words WARNING and ERROR. :-/ (Still not everything is all documented and unit tested properly; this is still a work in progress, mostly for internal reuse for now. Also, the matrix code from https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/people/jammc with some extra usability wrappers still has not made the cut just yet.)",
